WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.150
Donations: the ledger of gifts: every payment, receipt and refund, and which campaign or case it was for.

2
00:00:09.702 --> 00:00:17.740
Gifts made in DMs are recorded automatically; record cash or transfers with "Record a gift" so a receipt is issued.

3
00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:24.240
For an unpaid gift, "Send the payment request"; when it arrives, "Mark as paid".

4
00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:31.550
Send the receipt with "Send the receipt"; the "Report" totals gifts by campaign, type and month.

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:37.580
Don't delete a wrong gift; "Refund" or void it so the ledger stays correct.
